  "details": "This isn't the first nor the last keyboard-related issue. But I'm posting in vain. Hoping it gets piled onto the long list of stuff planned for the UI update.\nSimply put, VRChat's keyboard that appears in the menu for login, search, invite messages/e.t.c. should also appear on it's own when clicking on a text input on a UI canvas in a world.\nCurrently, the solution is to either use a VR dashboard's keyboard with the VRChat window focused, or grab a physical keyboard.\nThis is fine for Desktop play, but really cumbersome in VR.",
